---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Contact - Matt Hurley" 
  description="Get in touch with Matt Hurley via email, GitHub, or LinkedIn."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Contact</h1>

    <p>
      If you have questions about the projects documented here, want to discuss systems 
      thinking in software development, or are interested in collaboration on educational 
      technology, you can reach me through the following channels.
    </p>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
      <ul class="contact-links">
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong> 
          <a href="mailto:matt@matthurley.dev">matt@matthurley.dev</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GitHub:</strong> 
          <a href="https://github.com/theantipopau" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            github.com/theantipopau
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>LinkedIn:</strong> 
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/matt-hurley-29471a149/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            linkedin.com/in/matt-hurley-29471a149
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What to Expect</h2>
      <p>
        I respond to genuine inquiries about software architecture, education systems, 
        or technical collaboration. This is not a channel for commercial solicitations 
        or recruitment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Response times vary based on current commitments, but I aim to reply within 
        a few days to thoughtful messages.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
